      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: I recently realised the issue I was having was I installed git as per user rather than system so the detection couldn't find it but git worked fine. So I just enabled skip so it's fine.\nThe error still shows in GDB but it's a non-issue.\nSo this was really a non issue, it not detecting git when installed as user was.",
